The set of input forms grouped under Depths/Cements for analysis 
allows you to select the depths along the well to be considered 
for analysis and to define several scenarios concerning the 
material properties of the cement(s).
 
Use the form Depths For Analysis to specify the depths along the 
well for which analysis will be carried out.
 
Use the form Cement Properties to attach material properties to 
the various cement scenarios.
  